cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use spot-bayes, please cite the software and the paper for the model you
  fit: Shi, Zhang and Shaby (2026) for the shi model and the GPD + log-Laplace nugget
  construction shared by all models; Wang and Shaby (2026) for the wang model.
title: "spot-bayes: Spatial Peaks Over Thresholds with Bayesian hierarchical models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shaby
    given-names: Benjamin A.
    affiliation: Colorado State University
version: 0.1.2
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bshaby/spot-bayes"
keywords:
  - spatial extremes
  - peaks over threshold
  - extreme value theory
  - Bayesian
  - MCMC
references:
